         "text": "From the series for \\( \\sin u \\) with \\( u = 2x \\), \\( f'(x) = 2x - \\frac{4}{3}x^{3} + \\frac{4}{15}x^{5} - \\frac{8}{315}x^{7} + \\cdots \\).",
